<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/curiosity-map.css">
</head>
<body class="app-body">
  <div class="app-layout">
    <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>
    <main class="main-content">

      <a href="/curiosity-map/synthesize/observations" class="cm-back-link">← Back to observations</a>

      <div class="cm-synth-page">

        <header class="cm-synth-header">
          <h1 class="cm-synth-title">Notice</h1>
          <p class="cm-synth-subtitle">Some prompts to slow down with. Answer whichever ones land. These are just for you — they aren't saved.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="cm-notice-cards">

          <div class="cm-notice-card">
            <p class="cm-notice-prompt">What's a feeling that keeps showing up across your answers? Name it as a feeling, not a topic.</p>
            <textarea class="cm-notice-textarea" rows="6" placeholder="Type freely. Nothing here is saved."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="cm-notice-card">
            <p class="cm-notice-prompt">What's a contradiction you noticed? You wrote one thing here and a different thing there.</p>
            <textarea class="cm-notice-textarea" rows="6" placeholder="Type freely. Nothing here is saved."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="cm-notice-card">
            <p class="cm-notice-prompt">What's something that surprised you — you didn't know you cared about that?</p>
            <textarea class="cm-notice-textarea" rows="6" placeholder="Type freely. Nothing here is saved."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="cm-notice-card">
            <p class="cm-notice-prompt">If a friend read all of these, what would they say you really care about? In their words, not yours.</p>
            <textarea class="cm-notice-textarea" rows="6" placeholder="Type freely. Nothing here is saved."></textarea>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="cm-synth-nav">
          <a href="/curiosity-map/synthesize/name" class="cm-synth-btn">Continue to naming →</a>
          <a href="/curiosity-map/synthesize/observations" class="cm-back-link" style="margin-bottom:0">← Back to observations</a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
